\xspace
\section*{I/O File description}
\xsp
The list of units used within ATOMCI  follows. For each unit a
brief description and the default value for the unit number are given.
The names assigned in the control routine (\cntlnamelist NAMELIST) are employed
to organize the list. Alternative unit names, assigned within the seven
steps of ATOMCI, are also reported. The user will find this list of
essential help in restart procedures.
\xsp
\mtab{ FILES }{default:  7}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Summary file, containing informations on the return codes of the run and
on the consumed CPU time.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFAII    }{default: 18}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Atomic orbital integrals file. Generated in AIMAIN and used in TRMAIN.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFCIC }{default: 27}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Natural orbitals file. Generated and modified
in section 5 of CIMAIN (unit NFTV).
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFCID }{default: 24}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
One electron expression. Generated in section 1 of CIMAIN and used
in section 3 (unit NFTD).
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFCIH }{default: 22}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Density matrices. Temporary file (unit NFTH) in CIMAIN, is then
copied to unit NFCIW. Used within section 3 of CIMAIN.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFCIH1 }{default: 38}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Diagonal Hamiltonian matrix elements. Generated in section 1 of CIMAIN
(unit NFHD) and used in section 2.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFCIH2 }{default: 39}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Off-diagonal Hamiltonian
matrix elements. Generated in section 1 of CIMAIN
(unit NFHO) and used in sections 2 and 6.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFCII }{default:  0}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Initial CI vector, unit NFIV in CIMAIN. Supplied by the user
in section 2.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFCIS }{default: 71}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
File containing CI summary informations
passed from CIMAIN, section 6 (unit NFCI), to RSMAIN.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFCIV }{default: 37}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
CI vectors. Generated within section 2 of
CIMAIN (unit NFCV) and used in sections 3 and 6.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFCIW }{default: 28}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Density matrices and CI vectors. Generated and modified
within section 3 of CIMAIN (unit NFTW).
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFEXE }{default: 15}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Energy expression file. Generated in EXMAIN (see NFWFP, NFWFE) and
used in CIMAIN, sections 1 and 6, (unit NFTE).
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFEXW }{default:  0}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Incomplete energy expression file.
Generated in EXMAIN and supplied when restarting with RETRY=1 (see
\exnamelist NAMELIST). Defaulted at 14 in EXMAIN (unit NFEXW).
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFPTB }{default: 11}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Selected CSF. Generated within PTMAIN and used in EXMAIN and RSMAIN.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFPTH1 }{default: 32}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Diagonal effective Hamiltonian Matrix elements. Generated and used
within PTMAIN, section 2 (unit NFPTD).
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFPTH2 }{default: 33}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Off-diagonal effective Hamiltonian Matrix elements. Generated and used
within PTMAIN, section 2 (unit NFPTO).
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFPTL }{default: 35}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Work file generated and used sometimes within PTMAIN.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFPTV  }{default: 31}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
CI vectors in Perturbative CI. Generated and used in PTMAIN (section 3).
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFTBL    }{default: 88}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Work file. Used sometimes in WFMAIN and EXMAIN.
Contains temporary data on the CFP.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFTF }{default: 10}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Coefficients of Fraction Parentage, CFP, tables. Used in WFMAIN, PTMAIN,
EXMAIN and RSMAIN.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFTD   }{default: 20}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Direct access work file. Unit NFTRD in TRMAIN. Usually not used,
will be necessary only if the programs finds impossible to
perform the transformation wholly in core.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFTRC1   }{default: 27}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Transformation coefficients (NO's or original). Permanent file
generated in CIMAIN, section 5 (unit NFTV), and used in TRMAIN (unit
NFTRN).
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFTRC2   }{default: 21}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Transformation coefficients (NO's or original). Temporary file
generated in TRMAIN as a copy of NFTRC1 (and named NFTRC) and used
in CIMAIN, sections 3 and 6 (unit NFTT).
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFTRI    }{default: 16}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Transformed integrals file. Generated in TRMAIN and used in CIMAIN
(unit NFTA) and PTMAIN.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFWFB0    }{default: 11}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
CSF list for general CI. Generated in WFMAIN (unit NFWFA) and used in
EXMAIN.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFWFB1    }{default: 12}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
CSF list for SD-CI. Generated and used in WFMAIN (unit NFWFB).
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFWFE    }{default: 15}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Energy expression in the CI calculation. Generated in WFMAIN,
used in CIMAIN and in EXMAIN (units NFEXE for the complete and
NFEXW for the uncompleted EE files).
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFWFP    }{default: 14}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Energy expression in the perturbative selection. Generated in WFMAIN,
and used in PTMAIN.
\xsp
\end{indention}%%
\mtab{ NFWFW    }{default:  9}
\begin{indention}{12mm}%%
Work file.
\end{indention}%%
